{"ID":"20260620203416-9lnl79g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260620203416-9lnl79g","title":"系统框架","type":"doc","updated":"20260621202544"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204422-8cr334k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260620204422-8cr334k","updated":"20260621202544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体结构"}]},{"ID":"20260620204439-vy6oqh1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260620204439-vy6oqh1","updated":"20260621182502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体是一个嵌套结构："}]},{"ID":"20260620203942-cnapmp4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260620203942-cnapmp4","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204056-pz2476q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204056-pz2476q","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204056-f12gsz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620204056-f12gsz9","updated":"20260620222646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家主界面 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260620204059-ajosnzy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204059-ajosnzy","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204058-ih3x8j0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204058-ih3x8j0","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204058-gs0d4iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620204058-gs0d4iq","updated":"20260620222650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家玩的以B为主角的游戏内容 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260620204129-ykv2fwm","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204129-ykv2fwm","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204128-xag1r8y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204128-xag1r8y","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204128-xdl0qt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620204128-xdl0qt2","updated":"20260620222652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B玩的游戏的主界面 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260620204139-jst7vre","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204139-jst7vre","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204137-and3wh9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620204137-and3wh9","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620204137-abz1irt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620204137-abz1irt","updated":"20260620222656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"B玩的以A为主角的游戏内容 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260620223918-zsun748","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223918-zsun748","updated":"20260620224823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要注意的是，这不是一个完全等权承接下来的结构，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都可以直接与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进行切换，表现形式也就是在2状态下，随时可以拿出游戏机和收起游戏机，并且B在游戏机上玩游戏时，自己世界（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）的各种事务还是在进行的。到时候看看有没有实现难度问题或者实操起来的性能问题，有的话可以考虑略微改动框架偷点小懒"}]},{"ID":"20260620224238-zb3l328","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620224238-zb3l328","updated":"20260620224238"}},{"ID":"20260621182459-kcbflxu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621182459-kcbflxu","updated":"20260621201828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拍门前置（实现起来有点麻烦的核心系统）"}]},{"ID":"20260621182511-pzmm944","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621182511-pzmm944","updated":"20260621184543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在游戏开始时，要求获取玩家与门的大致相对位置，我目前的打算是以完全俯视图的视角在屏幕上显示一个尺寸不能变化的玩家与电脑（90％的玩家应该都会用电脑玩这种游戏吧），放在一个长方形（模拟房间）里，长方形可以通过拽住四角来改变位置和比例，先锚定玩家与房间的尺寸位置关系，再给一个小长条作为门，可微调宽窄并必须附在墙壁的某个位置，让玩家锚定门与墙壁的位置和尺寸关系。最后根据电脑与座位的宽度（应该是50-60cm左右，我身边没尺子，你们可以测测），计算出门往外一点相对于玩家座位的位置变换，储存到一个变量里，后续某些桥段会根据这个向量变量播放发闷的连续拍门声（发闷是模仿戴耳机的情况下听拍门声的音色，这个音效交给弄音效的同学处理）"}]},{"ID":"20260621184547-clybx0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621184547-clybx0w","updated":"20260621184759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个功能可能需要多次测试来微调算式才能实现略为精准的位置判断，但好消息是人一般在比较紧张且戴耳机判断能力模糊的情况下，来自那个大致方位的拍门声就会被直接怀疑成是拍门的声音"}]},{"ID":"20260621184808-ui8tddt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621184808-ui8tddt","updated":"20260621184812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大致效果图"}]},{"ID":"20260621184508-b7yy923","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621184508-b7yy923","updated":"20260621190338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"5ea5269ad54e9117e40fef01baa4e157"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/5ea5269ad54e9117e40fef01baa4e157-20260621190338-g1hmqcm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260621182459-p9vrjgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621182459-p9vrjgp","updated":"20260621190345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"}]},{"ID":"20260621190346-d35lb1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621190346-d35lb1s","updated":"20260621190350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"8f643d7eb19937ae474d2c27a0fd7e46"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/8f643d7eb19937ae474d2c27a0fd7e46-20260621190350-xk7jr0e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260621190342-7ie1bg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621190342-7ie1bg7","updated":"20260621190342"}},{"ID":"20260620211916-1wox4lf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260620211916-1wox4lf","updated":"20260620223032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"玩家主界面"}]},{"ID":"20260620220038-xb4nukh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620220038-xb4nukh","updated":"20260620220038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"d9c605f697ba5a129044d5d8af1c1764"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/d9c605f697ba5a129044d5d8af1c1764-20260620220038-dmlxuga.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260620213250-72h5jot","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260620213250-72h5jot","updated":"20260620222458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存档——"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"bc5eb297f31230445333c26af81bd4b5_720"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/bc5eb297f31230445333c26af81bd4b5_720-20260620214530-fuoj46s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260620214535-yoosqs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620214535-yoosqs0","updated":"20260620215416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一次打开游戏时，有一个旧存档和一个空档位。“返回”键随时可以点击并返回上一级，已经有存档的档位点击后会“选中”，此存档如按钮下陷，此时可以选择删除或读取。但在玩完全流程之前，旧存档选择后，删除与读取键会被禁用，要么是暗色无响应处理，要么是点完后红亮加禁止音效。而第一次进入游戏时，下面的档位是空档位，点击后会跳出新的一级UI提示“是否创建你的存档”“是”和“否”，选择“否”后返回，选择“是”后创建一个存档，接下来可以选择这个自己创建的存档进行“删除”或“读取”。"}]},{"ID":"20260620215419-y8dblls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620215419-y8dblls","updated":"20260620215527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（到时候UI会进一步设计，删除键最好做一下弱化处理，比如暗色以及比读取键小，防止误触，且点击删除后会再次出现一个二级UI再次确认是或否，点读取的话就直接读取）"}]},{"ID":"20260620222440-74pv4oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620222440-74pv4oc","updated":"20260620222458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以理解为其实就一个档位，上面那个旧存档基本是摆设，先不用管"}]},{"ID":"20260620211916-xo0p3k2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260620211916-xo0p3k2","updated":"20260620215709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置——"}]},{"ID":"20260620215702-fzeleym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620215702-fzeleym","updated":"20260620215702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是设置，具体内容以后再说"}]},{"ID":"20260620213133-cmflns2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260620213133-cmflns2","updated":"20260621201557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"退出游戏——"}]},{"ID":"20260620215709-9hzbpai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620215709-9hzbpai","updated":"20260620215709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是退出游戏"}]},{"ID":"20260620211916-1f3ftvv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260620211916-1f3ftvv","updated":"20260621201557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从“玩家主界面”到下一层级“玩家玩的以B为主角的游戏内容”的唯一途径就是选择第二个存档后点击“读取”"}]},{"ID":"20260621201557-l89mtta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201557-l89mtta","updated":"20260621201557"}},{"ID":"20260620220246-b80501e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220246-b80501e","updated":"20260621193222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"玩家玩的以B为主角的游戏内容"}]},{"ID":"20260620211919-5mnzq0f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620211919-5mnzq0f","updated":"20260621193222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运动系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620220733-hxce2ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620220733-hxce2ij","updated":"20260621193222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常规的3D第一人称，wsad移动和摄像头旋转，要有手，如果要手搓的话记得留一下移动（最大）速度变量和可以禁用移动的接口"}]},{"ID":"20260620220525-0xhkcjy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220525-0xhkcjy","updated":"20260621194557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"交互系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620221245-gzk5fai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620221245-gzk5fai","updated":"20260621194557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这块我做"}]},{"ID":"20260621192717-6e5zd54","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621192717-6e5zd54","updated":"20260621193406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特殊能力系统（暂定）"}]},{"ID":"20260621192725-y8j45er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621192725-y8j45er","updated":"20260621193406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后期获得枪和符咒，1和2切换，然后已拿出的情况下再按对应键是切换成空手。枪就是枪，右瞄准（减小FOV），左射击，不瞄准也能射击，不用做换弹系统，因为压根没几发子弹。符咒在门边可以按F键贴在门上，使得门在一定时间内无法被敌人通过，同样是有限资源。"}]},{"ID":"20260620220527-zd5qsis","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220527-zd5qsis","updated":"20260621193128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敌人系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620221758-jl3w6ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620221758-jl3w6ez","updated":"20260621190836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要一个能追踪主角且在室内地形环境下知道寻路不会撞墙的敌人AI，基本就恐怖游戏常用的那种鬼AI，默认状态下不需要外观（网格体），所以是不是个pawn都行。"}]},{"ID":"20260621190838-9r752rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621190838-9r752rl","updated":"20260621190933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敌人AI需要的详细功能："}]},{"ID":"20260621191103-mwruwpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621191103-mwruwpo","updated":"20260621192030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在室内地形环境下自动寻找最近路线追踪主角，"}]},{"ID":"20260621191134-wtblkm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621191134-wtblkm3","updated":"20260621191158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"默认隐身（不可视或压根没网格体），"}]},{"ID":"20260621192301-4dq60ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621192301-4dq60ig","updated":"20260621192338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"准备一个僵直事件，僵直期间无法移动，显露出类似人形的黑雾身体并不断抽搐（具体什么样到时候再说，但反正是要变得可视的）"}]},{"ID":"20260621190857-m28ob9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621190857-m28ob9a","updated":"20260621192335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"被子弹打中后僵直数秒，僵直结束后瞬移到一个与主角有一定距离的地方"}]},{"ID":"20260621191316-puo2bde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621191316-puo2bde","updated":"20260621191346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有脚步声，能正常和一些开了物理模拟的小物件（比如地上的皮球）发生碰撞"}]},{"ID":"20260621191407-tzv4bfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621191407-tzv4bfj","updated":"20260621191531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞主角后“游戏结束”，类似于杀死主角"}]},{"ID":"20260621191532-demyqsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621191532-demyqsl","updated":"20260621193128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到时候会有一个能贴在门上持续一段时间的“符咒”道具，贴在门上后门会被视为无法通过（或者说视为墙体）。贴符时，若有符门在当前敌人追击主角的线路上，且敌人与门距离\u003e=3米（这个数可能根据测试改动），更换路线；若有符门在当前敌人追击主角的线路上，且敌人与门距离\u003c三米，敌人不改变路线，随后与有符门发生碰撞进入一秒僵直，在此位置发出类似触电的音效，拍门音效和怒吼音效，随后更换路线。当持续时间结束，符咒消失时，若有更近的新路线，敌人更换路线。"}]},{"ID":"20260620220536-shv038k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220536-shv038k","updated":"20260621193004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菜单系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620221959-n3d3x6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620221959-n3d3x6g","updated":"20260620222307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在此层级时（注意前面这五个字），ESC会进入菜单系统，其中包含"}]},{"ID":"20260620222307-k9zw4z9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260620222307-k9zw4z9","updated":"20260621193004"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620222345-txxajst","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620222345-txxajst","updated":"20260620222345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620222345-k5r7fdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620222345-k5r7fdn","updated":"20260620222433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保存游戏——会自动让现在的信息覆盖玩家存档"}]}]},{"ID":"20260620222336-1p85ga3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620222336-1p85ga3","updated":"20260620222712"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620222336-l8evne5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620222336-l8evne5","updated":"20260620222712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"退出游戏到主界面——顾名思义，从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"退回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260620222341-zwigcwo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260620222341-zwigcwo","updated":"20260621193004"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260620222341-69qc2ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620222341-69qc2ez","updated":"20260621193004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回游戏（鼠标选中或再次按ESC都是）——顾名思义，留在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260620221033-glz9ukj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620221033-glz9ukj","updated":"20260620221119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存档系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620221043-e5uacd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620221043-e5uacd6","updated":"20260620221119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要一个到时候打算动不动写进关卡蓝图里的“自动保存”功能"}]},{"ID":"20260620220850-4eevsho","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220850-4eevsho","updated":"20260621200210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620220901-wxyd5nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620220901-wxyd5nx","updated":"20260621195402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个是比如说交互的UI，形如"}]},{"ID":"20260621195503-muhvaey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621195503-muhvaey","updated":"20260621195504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260621195504-tjxsmbg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260621195507-iomi3ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621195507-iomi3ne","updated":"20260621195518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中距离出现可交互提示"}]},{"ID":"20260621195519-4mcuzcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621195519-4mcuzcp","updated":"20260621195537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260621195537-e4qureg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260621195540-ua5qq3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621195540-ua5qq3r","updated":"20260621195545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近距离出现具体按键"}]},{"ID":"20260621195603-owqhsf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621195603-owqhsf8","updated":"20260621200210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后可能还有别的形式的UI，比如读报纸，但出现频率非常低，我完整脚本写出来要是需要再看怎么弄"}]},{"ID":"20260620211919-6hsp3c6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260620211919-6hsp3c6","updated":"20260621201413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩游戏系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620211919-f8dq9bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620211919-f8dq9bw","updated":"20260621201413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按空格（暂定）键拿出游戏机玩游戏 （从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进入到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3或4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），注意，此时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的一切仍正常运行，再按收起游戏机（从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3或4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），若处于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4则"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"收起游戏机时自动暂停"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层面游戏，要留个接口方便有的桥段走脚本强行从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3或4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"}]},{"ID":"20260621190754-wx63zrd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621190754-wx63zrd","updated":"20260621200306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台词系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621190810-1d7bzhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621190810-1d7bzhv","updated":"20260621200306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"准备两个HUD就行，都屏幕下方，一个字小点，一个字大点，可以随时被调取接口blit在对应位置数秒（留个可修改的持续时间变量和文本内容变量，还是整数据表什么的？我不太懂，刘宁决定吧）"}]},{"ID":"20260621193754-otwznn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193754-otwznn5","updated":"20260621193755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如"}]},{"ID":"20260621193755-8m9uxfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193755-8m9uxfs","updated":"20260621193755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"969af0d8944406e6c4211b15b4cda496"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/969af0d8944406e6c4211b15b4cda496-20260621193755-5alx1ss.jpeg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260621190811-012882w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621190811-012882w","updated":"20260621201118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死亡系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621201107-egfu17p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201107-egfu17p","updated":"20260621201118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雪花屏两秒，然后回到最近存档点"}]},{"ID":"20260621201118-bem2a18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201118-bem2a18","updated":"20260621201118"}},{"ID":"20260620220418-ywogs76","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220418-ywogs76","updated":"20260621201554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"B玩的游戏的主界面"}]},{"ID":"20260620220418-brrdpai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620220418-brrdpai","updated":"20260621194259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除了没有“退出游戏”，其他和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一模一样"}]},{"ID":"20260621201554-yq1suve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201554-yq1suve","updated":"20260621201554"}},{"ID":"20260620223130-nh1qf0m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260620223130-nh1qf0m","updated":"20260621194956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"B玩的以A为主角的游戏内容"}]},{"ID":"20260621194348-7shi41x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194348-7shi41x","updated":"20260621194956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运动系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621194349-ys6dow7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621194349-ys6dow7","updated":"20260621194956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"横板卷轴游戏，如《烟火》，AD左右走，W跳跃，S下蹲（这俩烟火没有就是了）"}]},{"ID":"20260621194600-vsmzcmo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194600-vsmzcmo","updated":"20260621195009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"交互系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621194601-acbc1zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621194601-acbc1zr","updated":"20260621195009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"E键，这块我做"}]},{"ID":"20260621194515-hljg0lj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194515-hljg0lj","updated":"20260621201439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菜单系统"}]},{"ID":"20260620223353-ghfofde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223353-ghfofde","updated":"20260621200940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"类似"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的菜单系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621200934-caws6r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-caws6r1","updated":"20260621201439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在此层级时，ESC会进入菜单系统（即暂停游戏），其中包含"}]},{"ID":"20260621200934-3ly9qgy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-3ly9qgy","updated":"20260620222749"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260621200934-cvczh8r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-cvczh8r","updated":"20260620222345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260621200934-e82iwe4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-e82iwe4","updated":"20260620222433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保存游戏——会自动让现在的信息覆盖玩家存档"}]}]},{"ID":"20260621200934-fuy8izi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-fuy8izi","updated":"20260620222712"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260621200934-on2spja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-on2spja","updated":"20260620222712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"退出游戏到主界面——顾名思义，从"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"退回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260621200934-mdlz4h9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-mdlz4h9","updated":"20260620222749"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260621200934-72c7v1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200934-72c7v1z","updated":"20260621193004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回游戏（鼠标选中或再次按ESC都是）——顾名思义，留在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260621194851-jeia8u4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194851-jeia8u4","updated":"20260621195237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存档系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621194851-w6ag1mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621194851-w6ag1mk","updated":"20260621195237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需要一个层级低于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的保存功能，也就是说A的游戏在某处死亡重来的话，B不会重来，B的游戏死亡重来，A部分的整体信息也会跟着回退"}]},{"ID":"20260621194851-yqc6bw1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194851-yqc6bw1","updated":"20260621200813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI系统"}]},{"ID":"20260621194851-7e34v1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621194851-7e34v1z","updated":"20260621200813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，中距离提示，近距离交代按键"}]},{"ID":"20260621200712-9r5vscn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200712-9r5vscn","updated":"20260621200731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预计还会出现一个类似读报纸的检视，等出完整脚本再说"}]},{"ID":"20260621194852-eybsihr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260621194852-eybsihr","updated":"20260621201547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及按空格放下游戏机停止玩游戏这么个事，我在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提过了，就不再重复了"}]},{"ID":"20260621200526-4cmajj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200526-4cmajj8","updated":"20260621200526"}},{"ID":"20260621201547-tv2hu13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201547-tv2hu13","updated":"20260621201547"}},{"ID":"20260620204153-bjnaic9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260620204153-bjnaic9","updated":"20260621201202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"角色B按键绑定"}]},{"ID":"20260620223354-diri73y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223354-diri73y","updated":"20260620223457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WSAD——前后左右"}]},{"ID":"20260620223443-vkxn40j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223443-vkxn40j","updated":"20260621201202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ESC——在“游戏状态下”打开菜单，即只有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​时可用，打开状态下再按继续游戏"}]},{"ID":"20260620223552-evbs69x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223552-evbs69x","updated":"20260620223559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"E——交互"}]},{"ID":"20260620223600-3dvh2qn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223600-3dvh2qn","updated":"20260621193920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空格——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的情况下拿出游戏机使得可进入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"3与4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"状态（此时手持物品切换为游戏机），再按回到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"}]},{"ID":"20260620223907-r11fnnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223907-r11fnnp","updated":"20260621193903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1——有枪后将手持物品切换为枪"}]},{"ID":"20260621193903-oefpes2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193903-oefpes2","updated":"20260621193931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2——有符咒后将手持物品切换为符咒"}]},{"ID":"20260621193931-ppvj6ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193931-ppvj6ks","updated":"20260621193940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左键——有枪后射击"}]},{"ID":"20260621193940-2uvgnwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193940-2uvgnwy","updated":"20260621193948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右键——有枪后瞄准"}]},{"ID":"20260621193949-2ooylxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621193949-2ooylxg","updated":"20260621193959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F键——有符咒后贴符"}]},{"ID":"20260620204433-ncyybds","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260620204433-ncyybds","updated":"20260621201453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"角色A按键绑定"}]},{"ID":"20260620223356-n52qbmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223356-n52qbmg","updated":"20260621200829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AD——左右"}]},{"ID":"20260621200830-d19yc5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621200830-d19yc5g","updated":"20260621201425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ESC——打开菜单，打开状态下再按继续游戏"}]},{"ID":"20260621201211-uci0w49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201211-uci0w49","updated":"20260621201216"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"E——交互"}]},{"ID":"20260621201132-ioplzvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621201132-ioplzvy","updated":"20260621201453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"空格——放下游戏机，会自动暂停游戏"}]},{"ID":"20260620223908-8x4ocey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620223908-8x4ocey","updated":"20260620223908"}},{"ID":"20260620220415-s819ez6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260620220415-s819ez6","updated":"20260621194313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"暂时搁置的部分，未来可考虑加花"}]},{"ID":"20260620220415-mog1uot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620220415-mog1uot","updated":"20260621194313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恐怖程度选择、配音、跑步频率的调整、手柄兼容"}]}]}